  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Research in Conflict and Protracted Crisis - Global Dissemination by INEE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed initiative would strengthen FCDO&#x2019;s ERICC programme through a dedicated focus Component to promote research uptake across the global EiE community. It would complement and reinforce the ERICC Research Consortium&#x2019;s and country partners&#x2019; efforts and extend their reach across the global EiE community. The goal is to improve the understanding of and access to EiE research, strengthen evidence dissemination, and encourage greater evidence uptake.</narrative>
  </description>
